  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'Ante up. Dealer gives two hole cards face-down and one face-up (third street), then a betting round. Then four more cards are dealt face-up one at a time with a betting round after each (fourth through seventh street). If the Queen of Spades is ever dealt face-up, the hand is killed: cards are thrown in, reshuffled, and redealt to players who had not folded. At showdown, best 5-card hand splits the pot with the player holding Queen of Spades in the hole (if any); if Queen of Spades was never dealt, best hand wins the whole pot.',
    Player: 'Ante up. Dealer gives two hole cards face-down and one face-up (third street), then a betting round. Then four more cards are dealt face-up one at a time with a betting round after each (fourth through seventh street). If the Queen of Spades is ever dealt face-up, the hand is killed: cards are thrown in, reshuffled, and redealt to players who had not folded. At showdown, best 5-card hand splits the pot with the player holding Queen of Spades in the hole (if any); if Queen of Spades was never dealt, best hand wins the whole pot.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the best 5-card poker hand at showdown, OR by holding the Queen of Spades in the hole.',
    gameplay: 'Ante up. Dealer gives two hole cards face-down and one face-up (third street), then a betting round. Then four more cards are dealt face-up one at a time with a betting round after each (fourth through seventh street). If the Queen of Spades is ever dealt face-up, the hand is killed: cards are thrown in, reshuffled, and redealt to players who had not folded. At showdown, best 5-card hand splits the pot with the player holding Queen of Spades in the hole (if any); if Queen of Spades was never dealt, best hand wins the whole pot.',
    keyRules: [
      'Qâ™  dealt face-up = KILL. Hand stops immediately. Reshuffle and redeal to remaining players.',
      'Qâ™  in the hole (face-down) at showdown = split the pot with the best hand.',
      'If Qâ™  is never dealt at all, best hand wins entire pot.',
      'Players who folded before the kill are eliminated from the redeal.',
      'Standard poker hand rankings apply.',
    ],
